    "description": "The delicious looking food item is Chicken lollipop biryani from Hyderabad Chefs. The day when i ate this for the very first time, trust me i could not believe lollipop can be this much juicy and tasty with the flavorful of biriyani. It was just amazing. From that day to today i ate Chicken lollipop biriyani only in Hyderabad Chefs. With my recommendation whoever comes here to eat this specific biriyani they all just amazed with the preparation, aroma, taste, all were on point."
