    "artist": "Karan Aggarwal",
    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0",
    "description": "Biryani is a rice dish, mainly made up by rice, meat, vegetables and spices. But this is a vegetarian version of biryani, I made it at home in pressure cooker to give \"Dum\"(a technique of cooking food by steam in sealed vessel, it is a slow cooking process) to biryani. As the name says the main ingredient is \"Kaju\"(Cashew Nuts) of this biryani."
  },
